:: Start [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Know Your Numbers</span></div>
  <h1>Why regular readings matter</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Checking your blood pressure regularly is how you and your care team know if
    things are on track. A single reading is a snapshot; readings over time tell
    the real story.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Why">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Why [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Know Your Numbers</span></div>
  <p class="lead">
    Your numbers are most accurate when you are calm and rested. Sitting quietly
    and breathing slowly for a couple of minutes before you measure makes a real
    difference.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    There are no readings to be ashamed of. Every number is useful information.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Play">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Play [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Know Your Numbers</span></div>
  <h1>How to play</h1>
  <p class="lead">🧘 <b>Rest first</b> — a short calming pause to settle.</p>
  <p class="lead">🩺 <b>Take the reading</b> — measure when you feel ready.</p>
  <p class="lead">🔢 <b>Enter your numbers</b> — they save to your history.</p>
  <p class="lead"><i>The game guides you through a short calming pause, then you enter your reading and it saves to your history.</i></p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "See the games">>
      <<run
        try {
          if (window.FlutterBridge && window.FlutterBridge.postMessage) {
            window.FlutterBridge.postMessage(JSON.stringify({ type: "CCQ_OPEN_GAMES" }));
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      >>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>
